            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>\"Finn\"</code> değerini içeren bir dizi saklayan <code>activeUsers</code> sabiti oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" activeUsers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Finn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Active:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(activeUsers)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Larry&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Active:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"[&quot;Finn&quot;]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>activeUsers</code>, ardından <code>[</code> ve sonra <code>\"Finn\"</code>, <code>]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
